NAME
       tls - TLS 1.3 client

SYNOPSIS
       #include <tls.h>

DESCRIPTION
       A TLS 1.3 client over an established socket. The suites offered
       are ChaCha20-Poly1305 and AES-128-GCM.

       The server certificate chain is verified against the bundle in
       /etc/ssl/certs, including the name and the validity dates, so a
       mismatch fails the handshake. Both wget and curl accept a flag
       to skip that, which is only for a host you already trust.

RETURN VALUE
       0 on success, negative on handshake or verification failure.

FILES
       /etc/ssl/certs

SEE ALSO
       crypto(3), wget(1), curl(1)
